{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54529","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲乙日，大（辛本、川本作「将」）忌白云前。\n若奔吾军还势急，理当速退（京本作「去」）舍平川，守固在（京本作「固守险」）高原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}